15      Spindle orientation angle [°]      +0             Tool orientation: -1=inactive/ 0-360=spindle angle in [°]  . 
16      Function spindle orientation       -1             Spindle orientation via: -1=NC/ 0=inactive/ +nn=Mnn M-Code . 
17      reserved                           +0             reserved                                                   . 
18      reserved                           +0             reserved                                                   . 
19      reserved                           +0             reserved                                                   . 
20      Connection and Activation Z-PROBE  +0             -1=inactive/ 0=auto/cable/ 1=IR-X12/ 2=IR-X13(or X112/X113). 
21      Mode to enable  Z-PROBE (DUO)      +0             -1000=RS232.H/-nn=MCODE.H/0=auto/+nn=Mnn in CYC/>1000=Mxx  . 
22      Mode to disable Z-PROBE (DUO)      +0             -1000=RS232.H/-nn=MCODE.H/0=auto/+nn=Mnn in CYC/>1000=Mxx  . 
23      Mode to switch on  Z-PROBE (DUO)   +0             -1000=RS232.H/-nn=MCODE.H/0=auto/1=X12.4/+nn=Mnn/>1000=Mxx . 
24      Mode to switch off Z-PROBE (DUO)   +0             -1000=RS232.H/-nn=MCODE.H/0=auto/1=X12.4/+nn=Mnn/>1000=Mxx . 
25      Mode tool cleaning function on     +0             -nn=Mnn in MCODE.H/0=off/+nn=Mnn in CYC/>1000=Mxx marker   . 
26      Dwell time [s] tool cleaning on    +0             Waiting time tool cleaning on  (>=0s)                      . 
27      Mode tool cleaning function off    +0             -nn=Mnn in MCODE.H/0=off/+nn=Mnn in CYC/>1000=Mxx marker   . 
28      Dwell time [s] tool cleaning off   +0             Waiting time tool cleaning off (>=0s)                      . 
29      reserved                           +0             reserved                                                   . 
